cept", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "E2E-F4-01..10 contra o compose real com opcsim; total L2 da fase = 34 cenarios."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_etapa_5_gate", "label": "Etapa 5 do F4b: gate final da fase F4", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rodada completa desde down -v: pytest + ruff -> L1 -> L2 34 -> Playwright F1 -> L3 roteiro INTEIRO; encerramento com relatorio e merge --no-ff apos aceite do usuario."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_solve_request", "label": "SolveRequest (dataclass picklavel)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "{y, u_applied, d, sp, reinit}: payload por execucao enviado ao processo worker; reinit => init_bumpless antes do make_step."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_solve_result", "label": "SolveResult (dataclass picklavel)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "{u_plan, prediction_t, prediction_cv, prediction_mv, cost, status: ok|no_convergence|error, wall_ms, detail}; excecao vira status=error com traceback em detail sem matar o worker."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_worker_main", "label": "worker_main(conn, config_json, ts_flow)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Roda no filho (multiprocessing spawn, padrao do script_pool): build_mpc no boot -> ('ready', dim); loop conn.recv(): SolveRequest -> make_step -> SolveResult."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_mpc_host", "label": "MpcHost (lado runtime do processo MPC)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "start() spawn + build assincrono (ready=False, status building); dispatch nao-bloqueante (ocupado => False); deadline 0.7 x Ts_mpc do dispatch => kill + respawn em background + resultado sintetico status=overrun; poll() entrega uma vez; crash detectado por sentinel => respawn + status=error detail=crash; worker_target injetavel para teste deterministico; stats() {alive, respawns, last_solve_ms}."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_mpc_block", "label": "MpcBlock (blocks/mpc.py)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Portas por config (ordem do spec 5.1); maquina de modos: LOCAL => readback/hold, nenhum opc.writes; REMOTO+MAN => manual clampado; REMOTO+AUTO => ultimo plano; fronteira n mod multiplier == 0 com dispatch em AUTO e poll() aplicando so na fronteira seguinte (buffer interno \u2014 determinismo RF-401); overrun => mantem MV + overruns++ + mpc_overrun; no_convergence/error => mpc_solver_error; invalidez => pula solve + ok=false; command() trata mpc_mode/mpc_sp/mpc_mv; health() {mode, overruns, last_solve_ms, worker: host.stats()}."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_operate_router", "label": "Router /api/operate (routers/operate.py)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "POST /{flow_id}/{block_id}/mode|sp|mv; require_operator; valida contra o graph_json (bloco mpc, categoria da var, sp_limits/limits => 422 pt-BR string unica); publica FlowCommand{cmd: mpc_mode|mpc_sp|mpc_mv, args, user} => 202; nenhum evento pela API."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_ws_fanout_mpc_state_impl", "label": "WS /ws fanout mpc_state (implementacao)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "_apply_client_message aceita chave mpc_state com ids '<flow_id>/<block_id>'; hub ganha segundo PatternListener (mpc.state.*) roteando {channel: mpc.state.<fid>.<bid>, data:{...}}; escopo F5 (eventos/valores) continua fora."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_health_endpoint_mpc", "label": "/health com campos MPC e script_pool", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Flows ganham mpc: {<block_id>: MpcBlock.health()}; script_pool: {size, busy, respawns} (debito 5, fim); L1 assere os campos novos (RNF-07)."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_conftest_malha_mpc_tfs", "label": "Setup E2E: projeto -> opcsim -> tags do pid -> flow MPC+TFS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Conftest reusa fixtures F2/F3: flow com MPC (1 MV com pid, 1 MV direta, 1 CV selfreg, 1 Restricao integrating, 1 DV) + TFS fechando a malha; tags write/mode_cmd/mode_read/readback no opcsim."}, {"id": "docs_plans_f4b_mpc_runtime_modos_gate_final_f4", "label": "Rodada de gate completa da fase F4", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/plans/F4b-mpc-runtime-modos.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Desde down -v (com auto